This file gathers and re-exports two-variable approximable maps, indexed directed unions, extension of a monotone action on finite elements, pointwise meets and pointwise unions of approximable maps, and the two-variable elementwise action, together with membership and order for indexed directed unions, uniqueness of a map from its values on principal elements, the principal and membership laws for the extension, membership for the pointwise meet and the pointwise union, preservation of directed unions, recovery of a two-variable relation from principal elements, and monotonicity of the two-variable action.
